# Theme

Narrative and token roles: [docs/theme.md](../../docs/theme.md). Read it before changing site chrome or colors.

## Must preserve

- Prefer existing CSS variables in `src/app.css` — do not invent new hex accents for site UI.
- Keep the Sicilian estate triad: paper ground, `--sea` action, `--olive` meta; Fraunces + Figtree; `--radius: 2px`.
- Text on sea / dark bands uses `--on-sea`; raised interactive tiles use `--surface`; soft media overlays use `--wash`.
- Cards only for interactive affordances (house tiles, forms) — not default editorial layout.
- Pills (`999px`) only for media controls; do not theme the archive browser.
- No dark mode, no palette redesign, no purple / cream-terracotta / broadsheet restyle.
